# Local WordPress test-stack mirror (see .runtime-wp/wordpress/wp-content):
# these files are synced verbatim from LF-only canonical repos (the sibling
# top-instal-generator repo, and this repo's own plugin source). Without this,
# core.autocrlf=true expects them checked out as CRLF, which they never are
# (they're written by the sync script, not `git checkout`), so `git status`
# perpetually reports them dirty even though content is byte-identical.
/.runtime-wp/wordpress/wp-content/plugins/top-instal-generator/** text eol=lf
/.runtime-wp/wordpress/wp-content/mu-plugins/** text eol=lf
